sent a round outline."},{"target":"round","sense":"shape","clue":"full moon","reason":"Both present a round outline."},{"target":"round","sense":"drinks","clue":"bartender","reason":"A customer can buy a round for the table."},{"target":"round","sense":"drinks","clue":"pub table","reason":"A customer can buy a round for the table."},{"target":"round","sense":"numbers","clue":"decimal","reason":"Numbers can be rounded to a chosen precision."},{"target":"round","sense":"numbers","clue":"nearest ten","reason":"Numbers can be rounded to a chosen precision."},{"target":"mark","sense":"school","clue":"exam","reason":"A teacher gives a mark for assessed work."},{"target":"mark","sense":"school","clue":"report card","reason":"A teacher gives a mark for assessed work."},{"target":"mark","sense":"sport","clue":"defender","reason":"A defender marks the opponent they are covering."},{"target":"mark","sense":"sport","clue":"opposing striker","reason":"A defender marks the opponent they are covering."},{"target":"mark","sense":"trace","clue":"stain","reason":"A stain or blot leaves a visible mark."},{"target":"mark","sense":"trace","clue":"ink blot","reason":"A stain or blot leaves a visible mark."},{"target":"mark","sense":"measurement","clue":"ruler","reason":"A mark on a scale indicates a measurement."},{"target":"mark","sense":"measurement","clue":"graduated cylinder","reason":"A mark on a scale indicates a measurement."},{"target":"mark","sense":"theater","clue":"actor","reason":"An actor hits a mark placed on the stage."},{"target":"mark","sense":"theater","clue":"spike tape","reason":"An actor hits a mark placed on the stage."},{"target":"check","sense":"finance","clue":"payee","reason":"A signed check orders payment to the payee."},{"target":"check","sense":"finance","clue":"bank deposit","reason":"A signed check orders payment to the payee."},{"target":"check","sense":"chess","clue":"king","reason":"A threat to the king puts it in check."},{"target":"check","sense":"ches